            <profile id="59ed-4989-87c0-26c2" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and large shield. May have light armour (+2) or heavy armour (+3). Army General. May be Veteran (+1).</characteristic>
